OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecome confined to the north overnight
OL,7,Fwith long clear spells developing
OL,8,Felsewhere. Winds away from the north
OL,9,Ffalling light, bringing a risk of
OL,10,Ffrost in well-sheltered parts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA few early showers in
OL,13,Fnorth, otherwise a chilly start with
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Cloud increases from the
OL,15,Fwest with occasionally heavy rain
OL,16,Fspreading east through the afternoon.
OL,17,FStrengthening southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
