OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing overnight to leave sunny
OL,7,Fspells and blustery showers Friday,
OL,8,Fthe showers becoming heavier, more
OL,9,Ffrequent Saturday with coastal gales.
OL,10,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
